SAFETY NOTICE (binding for users of this software)

This project is NOT a certified Battery Management System (BMS), NOT a
safety-rated industrial controller, and MUST NOT be relied upon as the sole
protection for LiFePO4 / lithium batteries, inverters, or electrical plant.

Active Modbus write / cutoff features are experimental, disabled by default
(dry-run), and may fail, misread, or write incorrect values. Always retain
hardware BMS protection, proper fusing, and certified equipment.

See docs/SAFETY_DISCLAIMER.md for the full safety disclaimer.
